      "settings": {
        "heading": "<p>Women are navigating more expectations, more information, and more noise than ever. <strong>Orbé</strong> was created to offer a different kind of space, one rooted in <strong>calm, honesty, and clarity.</strong> Our purpose is simple: to support women with knowledge, nourishment, and rituals that feel intuitive, not overwhelming.</p>",
