            "title": "Ingredients with Intention",
            "text": "Each ingredient is chosen for a purpose: how well it works, how well it absorbs, and how gently it supports your body. We source clean, high-quality nutrients and keep out anything unnecessary."
          }
        },
        "card_design_with_intention": {
