        "right_image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_2072749125_1.jpg",
        "heading": "The Heart Behind Orbé",
        "text_1": "Orbé began with a simple but powerful frustration: why does taking care of ourselves feel so complicated?",
        "text_2": "Women feel overwhelmed by noise, conflicting advice, and wellness trends that offer more confusion than clarity. So we set out to create something different; a brand built on intention, rooted in evidence, and guided by simplicity.",
        "text_3": "Orbé is the answer to a question women have been asking for years: What if feeling well could feel simple?"
      }
